Description: Add explicit std::cout for GCC 15
 GCC 15 no longer re-exports std::cout into the global namespace via the
 transitive cstdlib chain; SynchronizationModel.cxx uses bare `cout <<`.
 Back-port the upstream master fix (add <iostream> + using std::cout).
Author: Morgan Hough <morgan.hough@gmail.com>
Forwarded: https://github.com/pyushkevich/itksnap (fixed in master)
Last-Update: 2026-06-26
---
--- a/GUI/Model/SynchronizationModel.cxx
+++ b/GUI/Model/SynchronizationModel.cxx
@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
+#include <iostream>
+using std::cout;
 #include "SynchronizationModel.h"
 #include "GlobalUIModel.h"
 #include "IRISApplication.h"
